# story marker {"kind":"scene.transition","payload":{"target_id":"target.Day5"}}
return

label Day4.D.friday
# story entry day=4
# art scene draft.reading.late
\“When did she say she was bringing the rest on Friday?” I whisper, my thumb still resting on the turn axis at her waist. #id:line.Day4.D.friday.001
\“Before rehearsal,” Lavinia whispers back, a sudden, dangerous smile curving her mouth two inches from mine. #id:line.Day4.D.friday.002
\“Then I'll be here first.” #id:line.Day4.D.friday.003
\She laughs once against my mouth, her thumb sliding from my throat to my nape as she pulls me down onto the bench beside her. #id:line.Day4.D.friday.004
